  "title": "Remove Noise Occurring in Images [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "画像に発生するノイズを除去【RPGツクールMZプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "78ae9c71d81b7ec10bf1876e0fc6cd57ad6ff1a709dd524734a5dd6b75802359",
      "translation": "Remove Noise Occurring in Images [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "78ae9c71d81b7ec10bf1876e0fc6cd57ad6ff1a709dd524734a5dd6b75802359"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "画像に発生するノイズを除去します。",
      "sourceHash": "b66193940b38e196940fc0b794551c4f43b6e6f5670a8c774cb36850d1d22320",
      "translation": "Removes noise occurring in images.",
      "contextHash": "b66193940b38e196940fc0b794551c4f43b6e6f5670a8c774cb36850d1d22320"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ツクールＭＺにて、バトラーを移動させた場合、画像に線のようなノイズが入ることがあります。",
      "sourceHash": "9acb068601a1c881defee2ccac707918c6511f14a3dbc8058ea6c63886a768aa",
      "translation": "In RPG Maker MZ, moving a battler may cause line-like noise to appear in the image.",
      "contextHash": "9acb068601a1c881defee2ccac707918c6511f14a3dbc8058ea6c63886a768aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "これは内部的な処理における小数値の計算により、画像を切り抜く位置が１ピクセルズレることによって発生します。",
      "sourceHash": "6035dfbaa5960ff7e7369f6069fcb47daca0a8768513360cde7ffec855e96d47",
      "translation": "This occurs when fractional value calculations in the internal processing cause the image cropping position to shift by one pixel.",
      "contextHash": "6035dfbaa5960ff7e7369f6069fcb47daca0a8768513360cde7ffec855e96d47"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※線の正体はＳＶアクター自身やステートアイコンです。隣の画像パターンの端が表示されていると思われます。",
      "sourceHash": "af0f924e6ddec5393e526a515aa199aff9b9946797e68782aa97b805895ad911",
      "translation": "※The lines are actually the SV actor itself or state icons. It seems that the edge of the adjacent image pattern is being displayed.",
      "contextHash": "af0f924e6ddec5393e526a515aa199aff9b9946797e68782aa97b805895ad911"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "画像に対する設定を切り替えることによって、この問題を解決します。",
      "sourceHash": "821cea1e818caf684ede71eb914b23ff9e92ca3601c9fd94319ee55a7696cbba",
      "translation": "This issue can be resolved by switching the settings for the images.",
      "contextHash": "821cea1e818caf684ede71eb914b23ff9e92ca3601c9fd94319ee55a7696cbba"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のファイルをダウンロードし 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25",
      "translation": "Download the following file and place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON from the plugin manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＺ専用です。",
      "sourceHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d",
      "translation": "※This plugin is for MZ only.",
      "contextHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ＭＶではそもそも現象が発生しない模様です。",
      "sourceHash": "cbb1c5f0d6e6e31846f575e9e5040b716a448261d869b09b14a06c875f1babf8",
      "translation": "It appears that this phenomenon does not occur in MV in the first place.",
      "contextHash": "cbb1c5f0d6e6e31846f575e9e5040b716a448261d869b09b14a06c875f1babf8"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_BitmapSmoothOff.js",
      "sourceHash": "c695a12c2f66a15b281b5f9c483ac046350c2ae31759f0c4bec433980d47a070",
      "translation": "NRP_BitmapSmoothOff.js ",
      "contextHash": "bebfe34b653419bfaf1f90346d1a2983f6b614bcf81764bf90c2e9be03b72da8"
    },
