      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "適用するだけでＯＫです。",
      "sourceHash": "bba3ea506f92d2040ff9252a9835ffb9134ffa62ec8fa227591170183b84c114",
      "translation": "Simply applying it is sufficient.",
      "contextHash": "bba3ea506f92d2040ff9252a9835ffb9134ffa62ec8fa227591170183b84c114"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "画像毎に切り替えられるようになっていますが、通常は初期状態でも問題ないと思います。",
      "sourceHash": "41cd0d2b6a4fe612040322a334acc210805036efbdaf5a53a379b0065e6451ab",
      "translation": "It can be switched for each image, but normally the default settings should work fine.",
      "contextHash": "41cd0d2b6a4fe612040322a334acc210805036efbdaf5a53a379b0065e6451ab"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ",
      "sourceHash": "356c245db542a792ed22807f25f0f5d6b8db3fbb2069ca24851ed2c2846610b8",
      "translation": "plugin parameter",
      "contextHash": "356c245db542a792ed22807f25f0f5d6b8db3fbb2069ca24851ed2c2846610b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ＳＶアクターに適用（SvActorSmoothOff）",
      "sourceHash": "c43302c6c05edeeb4b52f157fe1dcf5fef52a50350ff123548841fbd0998430d",
      "translation": "Apply to SV Actors (SvActorSmoothOff)",
      "contextHash": "c43302c6c05edeeb4b52f157fe1dcf5fef52a50350ff123548841fbd0998430d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ＳＶアクター画像に処理を適用します。",
      "sourceHash": "4c916bd818f09279063b83bc66e6e89c391f7acb4c777ce2d756cc68ef4011ec",
      "translation": "Applies the processing to SV actor images.",
      "contextHash": "4c916bd818f09279063b83bc66e6e89c391f7acb4c777ce2d756cc68ef4011ec"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ステートアイコンに適用（StateIconSmoothOff）",
      "sourceHash": "4a3eb39c887df2ee676802fcb11184e72080928978fe950e7890051feff4fa5f",
      "translation": "Apply to State Icons (StateIconSmoothOff)",
      "contextHash": "4a3eb39c887df2ee676802fcb11184e72080928978fe950e7890051feff4fa5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ステートアイコン画像に処理を適用します。",
      "sourceHash": "84e7e79fd8997959a14eb9e789252ae3a98a7fa11849f327ae27e8c6bec2f79b",
      "translation": "Applies the processing to state icon images.",
      "contextHash": "84e7e79fd8997959a14eb9e789252ae3a98a7fa11849f327ae27e8c6bec2f79b"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "アニメーションに適用（AnimationSmoothOff）",
      "sourceHash": "cd424e4d1f1129a233593f6f17db29d5d0be7f2afd3c85b9b32d944b8cc6aac0",
      "translation": "Apply to Animations (AnimationSmoothOff)",
      "contextHash": "cd424e4d1f1129a233593f6f17db29d5d0be7f2afd3c85b9b32d944b8cc6aac0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "アニメーション画像（ＭＶ形式）に処理を適用します。",
      "sourceHash": "09daa141421c2afac549c44aa314ca83f76a181e4836e6587ebf399b70975207",
      "translation": "Applies the processing to animation images (MV format).",
      "contextHash": "09daa141421c2afac549c44aa314ca83f76a181e4836e6587ebf399b70975207"
    },
    {
